 * SCIENCE & RESEARCH 03 — DNA SEQUENCE ANALYZER
 * Pure Canvas 2D; planar molecular diagram; one continuous scene.
 * Seamless 25-second loop. time is in SECONDS.
 * Suggested export: 3840 x 2160, 60 fps, at least 100,000,000 bps.
 * The exporting encoder must enforce bitrate; Canvas only draws frames.
